### 1. Новый студент
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName": "Сертификат", "lastName": "Проверкин", "email": "cert1@test.com"}

### 2. Записать на курс
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentId": 9, "courseId": 12}

### 3. Пройти уроки
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments/7/lessons/21/complete

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments/7/lessons/22/complete

### 4. Сертификаты студента
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/9/certificates

### 5. Проверка по коду
GET http://localhost:8080/api/certificates/a5524afb-5174-4a69-a15b-2523429caf6a

### 6. Скачать сертификат
GET http://localhost:8080/api/certificates/1/download

### 7. Неизвестный код
GET http://localhost:8080/api/certificates/not-a-code